              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario, omu kwezi kwa mukaaga, aha kiro kyakwo ky'okubanza, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Zerubabeeli, mwene Shealutieli, omutegyeki wa Yuda, n'ahari Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai, nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Abantu aba nibagira bati: Obunaku bw'okugaruka kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA tibukahikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija nikiraba omuri nabi Hagai nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.64.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 64:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimugira ngu obu nibwo bunaku obu mushemereire kuraara omu maju gaanyu agashwekirwe embaaho omunda, haza enju egi ekaguma eri omushaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo hati MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Muteekateekye aha mitwarize yaanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mukabiba bingi, mwagyesha bikye; nimurya kwonka timurikuhaaga; nimunywa, kwonka timurikuhwa iriho; nimujwara, kwonka timurikutagatirwa; kandi n'orikukorera ebihembo, naabikorera kubibiika omu nshaho efumukire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
