            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwinamukye omu bibungo, mureete ebiti, mwombekye egyo nju, mbone kugishemerererwa n'okugihimbisizibwamu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukagira amatsiko g'okutunga bingi, mbwenu reeba, bibaire bikye; kandi ku mubireetsire omuka, naabihuuha, byatuntumuka. Nimugira ngu ekyo kireetsirwe ki? nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikubuuza. Kireetsirwe enju yangye kuguma eri omushaka, haza buri muntu omuriimwe akahugira aha kwombeka eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
