        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli, na Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru n'abantu boona abaatsigaireho, baayorobera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo yaamutumire; kandi abantu boona baatiina MUKAMA. ",
