          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Hagai, entumwa ya MUKAMA, yaagambira abantu ebi MUKAMA amutumire, naagira ati: MUKAMA naagira ati: Ndi hamwe naimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
