        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo MUKAMA yaimutsya omutima gwa Zerubabeeli mwene Shealutieli omutegyeki wa Yuda, n'ogwa Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, n'ey'abantu boona abaatsigareho, baija, baatandika kwombeka enju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga waabo, ",
